code: 0
--- stdout
The change is released

  From:      Ready, In progress
  To:        Done; an issue already there keeps it, so a repeat is safe
  Requires:  nothing besides the issue number
  Optional:  --comment
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Close:     closes the issue as completed; an issue already closed stays as it is
  Comment:   posted unless it renders empty or is already the latest gh-dojo comment:
               {comment}

Usage:
  gh dojo done <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --comment string   text for {comment} in the comment
      --dry-run          print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help             help for done
--- stderr
